{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537560/extras/TitleChar.png?t=1740805877\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quirky Forest</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced single player puzzle platformer</strong>. Help two inseparable friends to explore this wacky forest. Place the correct item at the right place, plan ahead, think carefully, <strong>this game is easy to play, but hard to master</strong>. Be prepared to be challenged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A big inspiration for the design of this game is <strong>Nintendo</strong>. I believe if you truly enjoyed titles as <strong>Toad Treasure Tracker, Super Mario 3D World</strong>, <strong>this game is totally for you</strong>, thank you so much for checking it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This Demo Features 13 Levels:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Tutorial Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Fast Paced Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Hard Levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you collect all the Diamonds?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537560?t=1740805877","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537560?t=1740805877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537560/bf34fee92f66edcd4652c553824ed2bccd93533d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740805877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537560/bf34fee92f66edcd4652c553824ed2bccd93533d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740805877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"fu